="00:46.440" end="00:46.650">just </span><span begin="00:46.650" end="00:47.070">so </span><span begin="00:47.070" end="00:48.180">tired </span><span begin="00:48.180" end="00:48.360">to </span><span begin="00:48.360" end="00:48.750">share </span><span begin="00:48.750" end="00:49.170">my </span><span begin="00:49.170" end="00:50.070">nights</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.250" end="00:54.180"><span begin="00:50.250" end="00:50.520">I </span><span begin="00:50.520" end="00:51.090">wanna </span><span begin="00:51.090" end="00:52.170">cry </span><span begin="00:52.170" end="00:52.410">and </span><span begin="00:52.410" end="00:52.590">I </span><span begin="00:52.590" end="00:53.190">wanna </span><span begin="00:53.190" end="00:54.180">love</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.330" end="00:59.070"><span begin="00:54.330" end="00:54.720">But </span><span begin="00:54.720" end="00:54.810">all </span><span begin="00:54.810" end="00:55.290">my </span><span begin="00:55.290" end="00:56.490">tears </span><span begin="00:56.490" end="00:56.640">have </span><span begin="00:56.640" end="00:56.970">been </span><span begin="00:56.970" end="00:58.350">used </span><span begin="00:58.350" end="00:59.070">up</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.340" end="01:06.660"><span begin="01:02.340" end="01:02.670">On </span><span begin="01:02.670" end="01:03.300">another </span><span begin="01:03.300" end="01:04.470">love</span><span begin="01:04.470" end="01:04.680">, </span><span begin="01:04.680" end="01:05.370">another </span><span begin="01:05.370" end="01:06.660">love</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.930" end="01:10.350"><span begin="01:06.930" end="01:07.110">All </span><span begin="01:07.110" end="01:07.560">my </span><span begin="01:07.560" end="01:08.970">tears  </span><span begin="01:08.970" end="01:09.330">been </span><span begin="01:09.330" end="01:09.870">used </span><span begin="01:09.870" end="01:10.350">up</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.530" 