 begin="01:58.680" end="01:58.920">But </span><span begin="01:58.920" end="01:59.190">my </span><span begin="01:59.190" end="01:59.760">hands </span><span begin="01:59.760" end="01:59.940">been </span><span begin="01:59.940" end="02:00.690">broken</span><span begin="02:00.690" end="02:00.690">, </span><span begin="02:00.690" end="02:00.900">one </span><span begin="02:00.900" end="02:01.140">too </span><span begin="02:01.140" end="02:01.770">many </span><span begin="02:01.770" end="02:02.520">times</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.610" end="02:06.480"><span begin="02:02.610" end="02:02.970">So </span><span begin="02:02.970" end="02:03.180">I'll </span><span begin="02:03.180" end="02:03.420">use </span><span begin="02:03.420" end="02:03.810">my </span><span begin="02:03.810" end="02:04.440">voice</span><span begin="02:04.440" end="02:04.440">, </span><span begin="02:04.440" end="02:04.650">I'll </span><span begin="02:04.650" end="02:04.800">be </span><span begin="02:04.800" end="02:05.070">so </span><span begin="02:05.070" end="02:05.180">*</span><span begin="02:05.180" end="02:05.290">*</span><span begin="02:05.290" end="02:05.400">*</span><span begin="02:05.400" end="02:05.510">*</span><span begin="02:05.510" end="02:05.620">*</span><span begin="02:05.620" end="02:05.730">*</span><span begin="02:05.730" end="02:05.880">* </span><span begin="02:05.880" end="02:06.480">rude</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.570" end="02:10.410"><span begin="02:06.570" end="02:06.870">Words </span><span begin="02:06.870" end="02:07.140">they </span><span begin="02:07.140" end="02:07.860">always </span><span begin="02:07.860" end="02:08.430">win</span><span begin="02:08.430" end="02:08.550">, </span><span begin="02:08.550" end="02:08.880">but </span><span begin="02:08.880" end="02:09.030">I </span><span begin="02:09.030" end="02:09.390">know </span><span begin="02:09.390" end="02:09.810">I'll </span><span begin="02:09.810" end="02:10.410">lose</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" 